# The corpus is shipped to the volume, never baked into the image — a multi-GB
# layer would make every deploy slow and every rollback expensive. dist/ matters
# just as much as data/: it is the release artifact, and leaving it out of this
# file uploaded 6.8GB to the builder on every single deploy.
data/
dist/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

.venv/
.git/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
tests/
overnight.py
whitepaper.md
